  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the resilience of communities affected by crises in Burkina Faso, through support for agricultural production capital and the empowerment of young people and women through economic activ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainably restore and manage productive capital to increase food and nutrition security in the short term, as well as the livelihood pportunities of vulnerable communities in the longer term. Develop the capacities for production, transformation and conservation of natural resources to expand local economies, employment opportunities and incomes for vulnerable communities. Improve collective organization, access and management of community-based resources to strengthen territorial anchoring and social coexistence between the targeted IDP and host communities as well as strengthen social cohesion through sustainable and inclusive resources management using conflict sensitive approach</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to Support vulnerable communities especially women and youth to adapt to, and mitigate the effects of climate, conflict, economic and other shocks, to strengthen their long-term resilience and social cohesion&#x25A3; &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9;&#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xB2E8;&#xAE30;&#xC801; &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9; &#xC218;&#xC694; &#xCDA9;&#xC871; &#xBC0F; &#xC7A5;&#xAE30;&#xC801; &#xC0DD;&#xACC4; &#xD68C;&#xBCF5;&#xB825; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;
